ublished: 22 June 1957\n\n# An Antibiotic with Fungicidal and Insecticidal Activity produced by Streptomyces\n\n  * R. CRAVERI^{1} &\n  * G. GIOLITTI^{1} \n\nNature volume 179, page 1307 (1957)\n\nSave article\n\n  * 484 Accesses\n\n  * 14 Citations\n\n  * Metrics details\n\n## Abstract\n\nIN the course of our investigations of antibiotic producing Streptomyces a substance was isolated, from a strain of the S. tanaschiensis type, that could not be identified with any previously recorded antibiotic, and which was active against fungi and also against insects. We have named it ‘flavensomycin’.\n\n\nThis is a preview of subscription content, access via your institution\n\n\n  1. Montecatini Antibiotic Research Laboratories, Milan\n\nR. CRAVERI & G. GIOLITTI\n\n\nCRAVERI, R., GIOLITTI, G. An Antibiotic with Fungicidal and Insecticidal Activity produced by Streptomyces . Nature 179, 1307 (1957). https://doi.org/10.1038/1791307a0\n\n  * Issue date: 22 June 1957\n\n  * DOI (Digital Object Identifier): https://doi.org/10.1038/1791307a0\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nChapter 2: (https://www.cabi.org/Uploads/ukncc/UKNCC%20Biological%20resource.pdf)\nciteturn12search12 [wordlim: 200] Appendix A Microbial properties: Antibiotic producing strains ... Flavensomycin\nNCIMB 8887\n\nDistamycin A  \n*Streptomyces distalicus* NCIMB 8936\n\nDistamycin B  \n*Streptomyces distalicus* NCIMB 8936\n\nDistamycin C  \n*Streptomyces distalicus* NCIMB 8936\n\nDuramycin  \n*Streptomyces cinnamoneus* subsp. *forma azocoluta* NCIMB 12681\n\nEchinomycin  \n*Streptomyces echinatus* NCIMB 9598\n\nElaiomycin  \n*Streptomyces gelaticus* NCIMB 9848\n\nEndomycin  \n*Streptomyces endus* NCIMB 9819\n\nEnteromycin  \n*Streptomyces albidreticuli* NCIMB 9600\n\nErizomycin  \n*Streptomyces griseus* subsp. *erizensis* NCIMB 10029\n\nErythromycin  \n*Saccharopolyspora erythraea* NCIMB 8665  \n*Saccharopolyspora erythraea* NCIMB 8594\n\nEverninomicin  \n*Micr